        <mxCell id="t-sub" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#526170;" value="The load-bearing split is how each client reaches the engine. The TUI and the CLI import WorkspaceManager in-process; the MCP server and the webapp go over the daemon&#39;s loopback HTTP. Dependencies flow inward and every store is named at the tier that owns it." vertex="1">
